# 9. Next Phase (Where Intelligence Starts)

Next we build the **Event Detection Engine**.

This service analyzes **track history** to detect:

```
traffic congestion
illegal parking
vehicle collision
```

This introduces a **very powerful architectural concept**:

```
Temporal Event Detection
```

Instead of analyzing **one frame**, we analyze **patterns across time**.

This is where the system becomes **a true AI analytics platform**.

